/// The V8 flags the built-in startup snapshot is made under, which makes them the only flags it can
/// be used with: V8 refuses a snapshot under any other set. They are what a default
/// `IsolatedRuntime` worker starts with (`--jitless` and `_isolated._HARDENING_V8_FLAGS`;
/// `tests/test_startup_snapshot.py` keeps the two lists equal). A worker with any other flags
/// starts without the snapshot, as it always did.
pub const STARTUP_SNAPSHOT_V8_FLAGS: &[&str] = &[
    "--jitless",
    "--enable-experimental-regexp-engine-on-excessive-backtracks",
    "--freeze-flags-after-init",
];
